Package: localsync-desktop-setup
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: kworld <access@kworld.space>
Depends: bash
Description: LocalSync desktop setup (git, SSH, bare repo, auto-discovery)
 Runs LocalSync's one-time desktop setup: installs git and SSH access if
 missing, creates the git bare repository LocalSync syncs your Obsidian
 vault through, and enables mDNS/Avahi auto-discovery so the phone app
 can find this machine automatically.
 .
 This package does not install a persistent application - it runs the
 setup once, during installation, the same as the terminal one-liner or
 the macOS double-click wrapper on kworld.space/localsync. Safe to
 install again later; every step it performs is idempotent.
